    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef3a8daf46610a8764bc8057",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "该怎么样才能引出你的魅力呢？\r\n看见那湛蓝天空与你洁白的花瓣相互映照之时，\r\n我就对你一见钟情了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "327a5651c3f9f62acc154931296056b72302d55cd6810293519f06a620b671ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
