    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1b52156496c0a28af2803e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且在日本终于见到你时，我可感动啦！\r\n我还会经常跑到樱花盛开的小路上，\r\n让自己沐浴在花雨之中……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd2f48aed1be2b1fdd04919319fa0ec1bf9f2e4908eb9edfe969083b5597933d",
