    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d043799d004aaeecf5b1df8e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵……感觉能做出非常美妙的作品呢～♪\n高度平衡做得也很帮，\n搭配方法亦是完美无缺。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ac68207bb5c187b3fd9668360216e34b78deea46d9049474a6d46c22abc0fef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
