        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:368cad42df6304e70a7a96eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看着她那惹人怜爱的一举一动，\r\n想必一定能完成满怀纤细之美的作品吧。\r\n我一边想象着，一边完成自己的作品……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f08a9f0c7d8a17b3b0b85d0213fa60637319313e1173965d8863b93ad4be869",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022510.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7e951018e6399ac89e44d99",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的插花作品终于完成。\r\n让人觉得风度凛然、不动如山——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9fefc052314b4528bda91d62e25911eadf4828dfbea28c0b5e6e5ab10463738",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022510.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
