      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿嘿，有种内心被人看了个精光的感觉，\r\n稍微有些害羞呀",
      "source_fingerprint": "38c90aefc2e7762128491ff63224381b503c5c428d16bce25b0cdc1e5e8fa092",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
