    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64c66feb1ca6114a1eede28c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这作品跟纤细八竿子打不着边，\r\n不如说简直是“强悍”一词的具现化！\r\n我大受震撼，不禁想凑近点观赏时——",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a802f57fea55294524cc6a30e8bc0b9f591188ace9a448b1bda5afb7881dac3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
