    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09d1ba471b804638019a5ddf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎嘿嘿，虽然事出突然，\r\n但我这么做还是不大体面了吧？\r\n不过你没受伤就好啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ad31ba74d03c34a376690b8c2a3e8253becd835f586dbc1327f50ad448ce7c4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
